title: Measures, 2026-11-15.
pid: c033e997-813b-4c92-8d6d-11702b4ef756
body: |2-
  "Four small cores" is four of this laptop's 3.5 GHz efficiency
  cores, standing in for four rented vCPUs. Memory is the peak of the
  whole tree of programs.
  | What                                                     | Run on            | Time            | Cores busy on average | Peak memory | Disk                       |
  |----------------------------------------------------------+-------------------+-----------------+-----------------------+-------------+----------------------------|
  | Your server over your notes (57,502 notes), 19 h running | all cores         | ready in 3.8 s  | 580 CPU-s in all      | 1.3 GB      | notes 418 MB, index 19 MB  |
  | Top's server over the team's notes                       | all cores         |                 |                       | 1.3 GB      | 362 MB                     |
  | One specialist's server                                  | all cores         |                 |                       | 0.4 GB      |                            |
  | One Claude program                                       |                   |                 |                       | 0.4 GB      | its logs 0.3 GB            |
  | Build from nothing: server and test programs             | four small cores  | 190 s           | 3.2                   | 4.1 GB      | 6.1 GB                     |
  | Rebuild after editing one file: server and tests         | four small cores  | 35 s            | 2.4                   | 3.7 GB      |                            |
  | the same, two at once                                    | two small cores   | 45 s            | 1.7                   | 2.2 GB      |                            |
  | Rust tests (1,226), one at a time                        | four small cores  | 47 s            | 0.9                   | 0.2 GB      |                            |
  | the same, four at a time                                 | four small cores  | 16 s            | 2.9                   | 0.2 GB      |                            |
  | the same, two at a time                                  | two small cores   | 27 s            | 1.5                   | 0.2 GB      |                            |
  | Whole suite, 'bash/all-tests.sh', as it is today         | four small cores  | 214 s           | 0.8                   | 2.0 GB      |                            |
  | the same                                                 | all 16 threads    | 168 s           |                       |             |                            |
  | its 76 integration runs (both editors)                   | four small cores  | 113 s           | 0.2                   | 0.2 GB      |                            |
  | Everything on disk                                       |                   |                 |                       |             | 22 GB, of which build 9 GB |
